# Geem Workspace frontend conventions

- Product name: **Geem**. Workspace UI lives in `apps/workspace_web`.
- Keep `apps/web` intact as the legacy MVP; never rename/delete it for SaaS work.
- UI foundation: Metronic Vite 9.5.0 **AI Concept only**, ported into `workspace_web`.
- Never import from `samples/`. Never mutate Metronic sample source.
- Do not port CRM/Mail/Calendar/Todo/Real Estate/Store Inventory concepts.
- Feature-oriented architecture under `apps/workspace_web/src/features/`.
- API access only via `src/services/api/` (no scattered raw `fetch` in components).
- i18n: `react-i18next` with `en`/`ar` and document `dir` ltr/rtl.
- Theme: `next-themes` with Geem-specific storage key; preserve AI Concept tokens.
- Brand avatar: local `public/brand/geem-avatar.webp` only (not user avatar).
